  "what": "How often the collapsed partition's SURVIVE representative -- compare_health_with_damage_multiples(max, health).0, an average over the f32 accumulator -- is not a member of the exact integer fan floor(max * r / 100) that Showdown throws from. An off-fan representative prices ZERO rolls of its own band rather than one. This is G8's first unmeasured remainder and the shape 19200244/115 exhibits.",
